OL,3,APlans to shut Marston's Brewery in
OL,4,ABurton revealed
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, it said the "stark reality"
OL,7,Fwas that UK cask ale volumes had more
OL,8,Fthan halved in less than a decade and
OL,9,F"this trend looks set to continue
OL,10,Facross the UK".
